{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12107290","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12107290","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1210729001:0":{"text":"We're wasting time here. Sonja, based on what you know of Nara, where would she go?","source_cn":"这样找下去太浪费时间了。索尼娅，以你对奈拉的了解，她会在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE337ED17BCE4D517","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210729002:0":{"text":"I'm not sure... My memories of Nara are mostly from our childhood.","source_cn":"……不知道，我只了解小时候的奈拉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE547C6EBEEFAFD9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210729003:0":{"text":"Alright. Any ideas, magister?","source_cn":"行吧，梅林，你怎么看？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE0EBA658771EA535","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Alright. Any ideas, magister?","female":"Alright. Any ideas, magister?","variant_male_record_index":"129825","variant_female_record_index":"129826","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1210729003":{"text":"Alright. Any ideas, magister?","source_cn":"行吧，梅林，你怎么看？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE0EBA658771EA535","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Alright. Any ideas, magister?","female":"Alright. Any ideas, magister?","variant_male_record_index":"129825","variant_female_record_index":"129826","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210729004:0":{"text":"Yeah, there might be clues there!","source_cn":"对，船长室说不定有收获！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFFF3508B2510C391","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Yeah, there might be clues there!","female":"Yeah, there might be clues there!","variant_male_record_index":"129827","variant_female_record_index":"129828","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210729011:0":{"text":"Sir Chippy will bravely lead you all! Let's go!","source_cn":"满满骑士得令，即刻出发——目标是船长室！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2EDDAE1BE672BAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"Let's check the captain's quarters.","source_cn":"去船长室看看","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x42E51BAE40037334","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Let's check the captain's quarters.","female":"Let's check the captain's quarters.","variant_male_record_index":"65432","variant_female_record_index":"65433","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210729005:0":{"text":"Perhaps we should check the captain's quarters. Even if we don't find Nara, maybe we'll find Tesio.","source_cn":"那我提议去船长室找找，就算碰不到奈拉，说不定能找到泰西欧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4F3A8FD63682DA93","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Perhaps we should check the captain's quarters. Even if we don't find Nara, maybe we'll find Tesio.","female":"Perhaps we should check the captain's quarters. Even if we don't find Nara, maybe we'll find Tesio.","variant_male_record_index":"129829","variant_female_record_index":"129830","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"Hmm... My mind is blank.","source_cn":"没有头绪","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3A3F404F68BC9587","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hmm... My mind is blank.","female":"Hmm... My mind is blank.","variant_male_record_index":"65434","variant_female_record_index":"65435","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210729006:0":{"text":"Oh no! Do you think this might be a trap? Should we get off this ship right away?!","source_cn":"主人是说可能有诈？那我们是不是应该马上离开这里？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x840BF60B1514824B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Oh no! Do you think this might be a trap? Should we get off this ship right away?!","female":"Oh no! Do you think this might be a trap? Should we get off this ship right away?!","variant_male_record_index":"129831","variant_female_record_index":"129832","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210729007:0":{"text":"No! Look, we've worked too hard to sneak in here. This is our golden chance to dismantle the Wights' hideout.","source_cn":"别啊，好不容易混进来了，这可是一把端掉水鬼窝最好的机会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6EFECAE2CBAE937","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210729008:0":{"text":"Let's check out the captain's quarters. They should have schematics of the entire ship so that if there's any trouble, we'll be ready.","source_cn":"这样吧，我们去船长室看看，那里应该有整个船舱的构造图，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89CAF3F64B53D5E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1210729009:0":{"text":"What kind of trouble?","source_cn":"什么准备？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07108E8D3F5D00DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210729010:0":{"text":"Like embarking on a legendary quest to take over the Chainkeeper! Chippy, why don't you lead the way?","source_cn":"比如说，开展一段夺取枷锁号的传奇故事。满满骑士，你要开路吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F7C0E43B363FDD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:2:3":{"text":"It's strangely quiet in here...","source_cn":"亡灵的警觉性低吗","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBAA271B7F0D4E26F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's strangely quiet in here...","female":"It's strangely quiet in here...","variant_male_record_index":"65436","variant_female_record_index":"65437","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"Sinbad","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"Sonja","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":3}}